# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NUKRAX — _redirects
# Clean `/page-name` URLs (NO trailing slash — that's the canonical
# form), handled entirely by Cloudflare's native _redirects mechanism —
# deliberately NOT implemented in worker.js or wrangler.jsonc, so those
# two files stay exactly as-is.
# (Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/)
#
# WHY NO TRAILING SLASH: wrangler.jsonc doesn't set `html_handling`, so
# Cloudflare uses its default ("auto-trailing-slash"), which serves a
# flat file like `dashboard.html` at `/dashboard` — NO trailing slash —
# automatically. The previous version of this file made `/dashboard/`
# (WITH a slash) canonical instead, which fought that default behavior
# on every request instead of matching it. This version's canonical URLs
# match Cloudflare's own default instead of contradicting it.
#
# Order matters: for the same source path, the first matching rule wins
# — each group below is ordered redirect-before-proxy.
#
# HOW TO ADD A NEW CLEAN URL LATER: copy the two-line pattern for any
# route below (one 301 line, one 200 line) with the new path/file.
#
# Group 1 — legacy `.html` URL → its new clean URL (permanent redirect,
# so old bookmarks/links/search results still resolve).
/dashboard.html               /dashboard               301
/marketplace.html             /marketplace             301
/community.html                /community              301
/leaderboard.html              /leaderboard             301
/account.html                  /account                 301
/settings.html                 /settings                301
/contact.html                   /contact                301
/profile.html                   /profile                301
/feedback.html                   /feedback               301
/chat.html                      /chat                    301
/map.html                        /map                    301
/tr.html                         /tr                      301
/cr.html                         /cr                      301
/ea-selection.html              /ea-section              301
/develop/ea.html                 /develop/ea              301
/develop/automation.html         /develop/automation      301
/p.html                          /privacy                 301

# Group 2 — the OLD trailing-slash URLs from a previous version of this
# scheme (e.g. `/dashboard/`) → the new no-slash canonical form. Kept so
# any link/bookmark generated while that scheme was live still resolves
# instead of breaking.
/dashboard/                    /dashboard               301
/marketplace/                   /marketplace             301
/community/                    /community               301
/leaderboard/                   /leaderboard             301
/account/                       /account                 301
/settings/                      /settings                301
/contact/                        /contact                 301
/profile/                        /profile                 301
/feedback/                        /feedback                301
/chat/                           /chat                    301
/map/                             /map                     301
/tr/                              /tr                       301
/cr/                              /cr                       301
/ea-section/                     /ea-section               301
/develop/ea/                      /develop/ea               301
/develop/automation/              /develop/automation       301
/privacy/                         /privacy                  301

# Group 3 — the clean URL itself → invisibly served from the real file
# (proxy/200 = address bar keeps showing the clean URL; no client-side
# redirect, works on direct load/refresh/deep-link).
/dashboard                     /dashboard.html           200
/marketplace                    /marketplace.html         200
/community                     /community.html           200
/leaderboard                    /leaderboard.html         200
/account                        /account.html             200
/settings                       /settings.html            200
/contact                         /contact.html             200
/profile                         /profile.html             200
/feedback                         /feedback.html            200
/chat                            /chat.html                200
/map                              /map.html                 200
/tr                                /tr.html                  200
/cr                                /cr.html                  200
/ea-section                      /ea-selection.html        200
/develop/ea                       /develop/ea.html          200
/develop/automation                /develop/automation.html  200
/privacy                          /p.html                   200
